  "candidate": "Six-point degree-five local Lagrange interpolation at integer offsets -2,-1,0,1,2,3; not Monaghan M6. Existing native 3D option is experimental; current planar configuration and solid-wall 3D scatter explicitly reject it.",
  "moment_reproduction": {
    "formula": "w_j(f)=product_{k=-2..3,k!=j}(f-k)/(j-k)",
    "identities": "sum_j w_j(f)*j^n=f^n for n=0..5; hence centred moments1..5 vanish on complete support. Tensor products preserve circulation and XY first/second moments without changing span/volume.",
